---
/* Component — DisplayCardTitleBadge
 * A small label above the card title — a short qualifier such as a status or a
 * category. Plain text, deliberately not a pill: a border, background and
 * corner radius are not wanted here.
 *
 * Renders as a sibling *before* DisplayCardTitle, never nested inside it.
 * DisplayCardTitle is a flex row, so a nested badge would sit beside the title
 * rather than above it.
 *
 * Two taste decisions want a look at the rendered preview:
 *   - <p> as the element. <small> would add "side comment" semantics that may
 *     not be wanted; a <span> would need forcing to block.
 *   - No colour, so the badge inherits the card's text colour; muted may read
 *     better for a qualifier.
 *
 * margin-block: 0 is declared rather than assumed. The library ships no reset,
 * so a <p> otherwise takes the browser's 1em block margins and the badge would
 * float away from the title it labels. */
---

<p>
  <slot />
</p>

<style>
  p {
    font-family: var(--bravoixr-font-body);
    font-size: var(--bravoixr-text-label);
    font-weight: var(--bravoixr-weight-label);
    line-height: var(--bravoixr-leading-prose);
    letter-spacing: var(--bravoixr-tracking-prose);
    margin-block: 0;
  }
</style>
